classmethods::

method:: ar, kr

A band-limited oscillator at audio or control rate.

argument:: freq

Frequency in Hz.

argument:: mul

Amplitude multiplier, default code::1::.

returns::

A UGen.

discussion::

Use code::ar:: for audio-rate and code::kr:: for control-rate signals.

method:: offset

Apply a DC offset.

argument:: amount

The offset amount.

